      "title": "INVH Q3 FFO Meets Estimates, Revenues Miss, '26 Views Raised",
      "summary": "Invitation Homes (INVH) reported Q3 2026 core FFO of 48 cents per share, matching consensus estimates, with revenues rising 6.3% to $731.28 million. The company raised its 2026 core FFO guidance midpoint to $1.96 per share and improved same-store NOI outlook. Blended rental rate growth improved to 3%, though occupancy dipped slightly to 96.4%. INVH completed $318 million in home dispositions and repurchased 8.87 million shares for $250 million.",
